<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 587 0 R/E(pVHn vyly pVHo qy Kyfx vyly Kyfo [ Awpxy swQIAW nwl ipAwr rKo qy Kyfo [ im`tI G`\032ty ivc Kyfx nwl kpVy mYly ho jWdy hn [ Kyf AijhI Kyfo ijs ivc iksy nwl lVweI nw hovy[ iksy nwl DoKw jW SYqwnI nw kro qy rOlw nw pwau [ Kyf \206 Kyf dI Bwvnw nwl Kyfo [ bdly jW lVweI dI Bwvnw nwl nw Kyfo [)/Pg 167 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

7043 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 587 0 R/E(Playing is essential for maintaining good health. It's important to balance study and play, dedicating time for each. Cherish your friends and enjoy playing together. While playing in the mud, your clothes could get dirty. Choose games that avoid conflicts. It's crucial to avoid cheating or causing trouble and to keep noise levels down. Approach games with a positive spirit, focusing on enjoyment rather than competition or hostility.)/Pg 167 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

