7295 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 616 0 R/T(The amount of reward you get from doing Seva and Simran from 1000 lifetimes, by taking on the teachings from Guru Ji and great Gursikhs, that reward can be attained in 1 lifetime. All blessings are received by taking on these teachings. While taking teachings on and doing Simran, do not let your pride grow. Think in your mind that Guru Sahib Ji has blessed me with these virtues. By thinking in ego, bad virtues are born within which will destroy all the rewards of your Seva and Simran)/E(The amount of reward you get from doing Seva and Simran from 1000 lifetimes, by taking on the teachings from Guru Ji and great Gursikhs, that reward can be attained in 1 lifetime. All blessings are received by taking on these teachings. While taking teachings on and doing Simran, do not let your pride grow. Think in your mind that Guru Sahib Ji has blessed me with these virtues. By thinking in ego, bad virtues are born within which will destroy all the rewards of your Seva and Simran)/Pg 196 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

