11760 0 obj
<</Title(Show the utmost respect for religious scriptures, do not touch with unwashed hands and do not read while wearing shoes. Do not put them in a low place or where your feet could be facing. It is advised to put it on the side of your pillow where your head lays in a high, clean place with a clean covering over the top. Do not put religious pictures where your feet will face. Don\220t put Gurbani scriptures where your back would face.)/Dest[205 0 R/Fit]/Parent 11154 0 R/Prev 11759 0 R>>
endobj

